  "historyNote": "#6629, eff 1-1-98; amd by #7926, eff 1-1-04; ss by #8442, eff 1-1-06; ss by #8671, eff 1-1-07; amd by #9773-A, eff 1-1-11; ss by #10007, eff 1-1-12; ss by #12510, eff 4-6-18",
